        (∀ g ∈ GfC W, ∀ Φ ∈ algF ψ θ true A B, GlobalTheory.TripleAssembly.mapA ψ e Bs Γ R Rf (ωA (g, 1) Φ) = GlobalTheory.TripleAssembly.mapA ψ e Bs Γ R Rf Φ) ∧
